# Keep the server list byte-for-byte as Windscribe ships it.
#
# locations.json is 5,690 lines of JSON that the app never edits in the repository - it only rewrites
# it at runtime. Without this, Git's autocrlf normalisation rewrites the whole file on checkout, which
# produced two commits whose entire diff was that churn and made them look 5,690 lines long.
locations.json -text
